{"ref":"BDB, רַעֲנָן","hw":"רַעֲנָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רַעֲנָן</span></big>  <strong>adj. luxuriant, fresh</strong>;—m. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.2\">Dt 12:2</a> +; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">רַעֲנָנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:16\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.16\">Ct 1:16</a>; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רַעֲנַנִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:15\" href=\"/Psalms.92.15\">ψ 92:15</a>;—<em>luxuriant</em>, of trees: <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרוֹשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 14:9\" href=\"/Hosea.14.9\">Ho 14:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זַיִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 52:10\" href=\"/Psalms.52.10\">ψ 52:10</a> (both sim.), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.16\">Je 11:16</a> (fig.); sim. also, <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּאֶזְרָה ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:35\" href=\"/Psalms.37.35\">ψ 37:35</a> (but read <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּאֶרֶז הַלְּבָנוֹן</span> 𝔊 and most); especially in phrase <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחַת כָּל־עֵץ ר׳</span> place of idolatrous rites, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.2\">Dt 12:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:23\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.23\">1 K 14:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.4\">2 K 16:4</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.4\">2 Ch 28:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.10\">2 K 17:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.20\">Je 2:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.6\">3:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.5\">Is 57:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.13\">Ez 6:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־עֵץ ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.2\">Je 17:2</a> (si vera l.); leaf v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.8\">8</a> (fig.); leafy couch <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:16\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.16\">Ct 1:16</a>; <em>fresh</em>, oil <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:11\" href=\"/Psalms.92.11\">ψ 92:11</a>; <em>fresh, flourishing</em>, pers. (fig., as trees) v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:15\" href=\"/Psalms.92.15\">15</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּשֵׁנִים</span>).","next":"BDB, רעע","prev":"BDB, רָעַן"}